<title>USA: Gabelli group cuts TransPro stake.</title>
<headline>Gabelli group cuts TransPro stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Friday it reduced its stake in TransPro Inc to 13.57 percent or 894,125 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 33,700 shares of TransPro between July 29 and September 25 at prices ranging from $6.00 to $7.8333 a share.</p>
